    "check_size_anomaly",
    "check_sl011"
  ],
  "known_parity_gaps": [
    "Seven 1s and one 262145: Python emits one SL011 finding, ratio round(262145/1, 3) = 262145.0, record_index 7. Rust check_size_anomaly returns FINGERPRINT_CODEC_UNAVAILABLE because the fingerprint codec is not ported. Evidence uses PyValue with ratio None because PyValue has no float.",
    "Integers that do not fit i64, and median * 20 overflow, are PYTHON_INT_UNBOUNDED in Rust. Python keeps the unbounded int.",
    "i64 as f64 is inexact above 2^53. Do not add vectors in that range."
  ],
